export function ensureGroups(state){state.orders??=[0,0];state.groupOrders??=[{1:state.orders[0]||0},{1:state.orders[1]||0}];for(const u of state.units||[])u.combatGroup??=1;}
export function sources(state,u){if(CP.isCyber(u)&&!CP.valid(u))return [];if(u.peripheral&&!CP.independent(u)){const c=state.units.find(v=>v.id===u.controllerId);return c&&S.onTable(u)&&S.active(u)&&!S.has(u,'disconnected')?sources(state,c).map(([k,v])=>[k,'控制者 '+v]):[];}if(u.isDeployable||u.noOrders&&!CP.independent(u)||!S.active(u)||u.proxyGroup&&S.has(u,'isolated'))return [];if(state.impetuousPhase)return I.eligible(u,state)&&u.impetuousAvailable?[['impetuous','鲁莽激活 · 不消耗公共命令']]:[];const isolated=S.has(u,'isolated'),out=[];if(S.has(u,'hiddenDeployment')&&u.hiddenOrderAvailable!==false)out.push(['hidden','隐匿部署保留命令 · 仅自己使用']);if(!isolated&&regular(state,u)>0)out.push(['regular',`G${group(u)} 正规命令 · ${regular(state,u)}`]);if(!isolated&&(u.lieutenant||u.nco)&&(state.lieutenantOrders?.[u.team]||0)>0)out.push(['lieutenant','尉官命令 · '+state.lieutenantOrders[u.team]]);if((u.irregular||0)>0)out.push(['irregular','自身非正规 · '+u.irregular]);if(!isolated&&(u.tacticalOrders||0)>0)out.push(['tactical','战术意识 · '+u.tacticalOrders]);return out;}
export function spend(state,u,key){if(u.peripheral&&!CP.independent(u)){if(!sources(state,u).some(s=>s[0]===key))return false;return spend(state,state.units.find(v=>v.id===u.controllerId),key);}if(!sources(state,u).some(s=>s[0]===key))return false;if(key==='hidden'){u.hiddenOrderAvailable=false;return true;}if(key==='impetuous')return I.activate(u,state).can;if(key==='regular'){if(state.groupOrders){state.groupOrders[u.team][group(u)]--;state.orders[u.team]=Object.values(state.groupOrders[u.team]).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);}else state.orders[u.team]--;}else if(key==='lieutenant')state.lieutenantOrders[u.team]--;else if(key==='irregular')u.irregular--;else u.tacticalOrders--;return true;}
export function personal(u){return [u.irregularTroop||S.has(u,'isolated')||u.irregular?`非正规 ${u.irregular||0}`:'',u.impetuous?`鲁莽 ${u.impetuousAvailable?1:0}`:'',u.tacticalAwareness?`战术 ${u.tacticalOrders||0}`:''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');}
export function refresh(state,team){
 ensureGroups(state);const units=PJ.contributors(state.units.filter(u=>u.team===team&&!u.peripheral&&!u.isDeployable&&!u.noOrders)),pool={};
 for(const u of units){u.hiddenOrderAvailable=S.has(u,'hiddenDeployment')&&S.active(u);pool[group(u)]??=0;const active=S.active(u)&&S.onTable(u),isolated=S.has(u,'isolated');u.irregular=active&&!u.possession&&(u.irregularTroop||isolated)?1:0;u.tacticalOrders=u.tacticalAwareness&&active&&!isolated&&!u.possession?1:0;u.impetuousAvailable=!!u.impetuous&&active;if(active&&!u.possession&&!u.irregularTroop&&!isolated)pool[group(u)]+=u.regularOrderCount??1;}
 state.groupOrders[team]=pool;state.orders[team]=Object.values(pool).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);state.lieutenantOrders??=[0,0];state.lieutenantOrders[team]=units.filter(u=>u.lieutenant&&!u.possession&&S.active(u)&&!S.has(u,'isolated')).reduce((n,u)=>n+(u.lieutenantOrderCount??1),0);const strategist=units.find(u=>u.lieutenant&&u.strategos&&S.active(u)&&S.onTable(u)&&!S.has(u,'isolated'));if(strategist){pool[group(strategist)]=(pool[group(strategist)]||0)+state.lieutenantOrders[team];state.orders[team]=Object.values(pool).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);state.lieutenantOrders[team]=0;}
}
